  {
    "id": 2089,
    "date": "2023-09-06T20:02:53+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "Along the Mohawk River Trail in Rome New York",
    "media": "2089_IMG_2680.MOV"
  },
  {
    "id": 2090,
    "date": "2023-09-07T21:08:38+00:00",
    "from": "tour2020",
    "text": "23+ years of bicycle touring - old man now.  When you are young, you don't realize you are young, so take advantage of all youthfulness has to offer.  But how does one know what youthfulness has to offer until one gets old? Listen to your wise old elders, even if they too have a lot of problems.",
    "media": "2090.jpg"
  },
  {
